concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Objects"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "The objects of this Act are:  (a) to establish the Australian Civilian Corps; and  (b) to provide a legal framework for the effective and fair employment and management of Australian Civilian Corps employees." ;
    skos:definition "The objects of this Act are:  (a) to establish the Australian Civilian Corps; and  (b) to provide a legal framework for the effective and fair employment and management of Australian Civilian Corps employees."@en ;
