concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Secretary’s directions about the Australian Civilian Corps Values"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, issue directions in relation to each of the Australian Civilian Corps Values for the purposes of determining, where necessary, the scope or application of the Australian Civilian Corps Values.  (2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the Australian Civilian Corps Values have effect subject to the restrictions (if any) in directions made under subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, issue directions in relation to each of the Australian Civilian Corps Values for the purposes of determining, where necessary, the scope or application of the Australian Civilian Corps Values.  (2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the Australian Civilian Corps Values have effect subject to the restrictions (if any) in directions made under subsection (1)."@en ;
