concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may prescribe the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531   Australian Civilian Corps  Part 2  Section 16  Australian Civilian Corps Act 2011  (2) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct must include a rule that an Australian Civilian Corps employee must at all times behave in a way that upholds the Australian Civilian Corps Values.  (3) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct applies to Australian Civilian Corps employees." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may prescribe the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531   Australian Civilian Corps  Part 2  Section 16  Australian Civilian Corps Act 2011  (2) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct must include a rule that an Australian Civilian Corps employee must at all times behave in a way that upholds the Australian Civilian Corps Values.  (3) The Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct applies to Australian Civilian Corps employees."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f77ef6a9a472c6dc463d8059e31e04d15af1b769e46ddf631cd876ebdd863b18" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
