concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 Breaches of the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "Breaches  (1) The Secretary may impose the following sanctions on an Australian Civilian Corps employee who is found (under procedures established under subsection (3)) to have breached the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct:  (a) termination of employment;  (b) re-assignment of duties;  (c) deductions from salary, by way of fine;  (d) a reprimand.  (2) The regulations may prescribe limitations on the power of the Secretary to impose sanctions under subsection (1). Procedures  (3) The Secretary must establish procedures for determining whether an Australian Civilian Corps employee has breached the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531" ;
    skos:definition "Breaches  (1) The Secretary may impose the following sanctions on an Australian Civilian Corps employee who is found (under procedures established under subsection (3)) to have breached the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct:  (a) termination of employment;  (b) re-assignment of duties;  (c) deductions from salary, by way of fine;  (d) a reprimand.  (2) The regulations may prescribe limitations on the power of the Secretary to impose sanctions under subsection (1). Procedures  (3) The Secretary must establish procedures for determining whether an Australian Civilian Corps employee has breached the Australian Civilian Corps Code of Conduct. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "05c239c39f0fed5986e6e0c085651451353feab91453d08a936ddbdbb676f099" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-17-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-17-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-17-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf, p.9" .
