concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-17a-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A(9) Review of decisions relating to breaches of Australian Civilian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17a-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) Without limiting subsection (1), regulations made for the purposes of that subsection may provide for the powers available to a person or committee that conducts a review under this section. Recommendations in a report on a review" ;
    skos:definition "(9) Without limiting subsection (1), regulations made for the purposes of that subsection may provide for the powers available to a person or committee that conducts a review under this section. Recommendations in a report on a review"@en ;
