concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Termination of employment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may at any time, by written notice, terminate the employment of an Australian Civilian Corps employee. Note: The Fair Work Act 2009 has rules and entitlements that apply to termination of employment.  (2) The notice must set out the ground or grounds for the termination." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may at any time, by written notice, terminate the employment of an Australian Civilian Corps employee. Note: The Fair Work Act 2009 has rules and entitlements that apply to termination of employment.  (2) The notice must set out the ground or grounds for the termination."@en ;
