concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-27 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27 Prime Minister may issue directions about leave etc. to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-27 ;
    values:originalText "Commonwealth employers Commonwealth employer  (1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following persons is a Commonwealth employer:  (a) a person who, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has the powers of an employer in respect of an employee of the Commonwealth;  (b) a body corporate that:  (i) is established by or under a law of the Commonwealth for a public purpose; and  (ii) has employees;  (c) a company that:  (i) is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); and  (ii) has employees. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531" ;
    skos:definition "Commonwealth employers Commonwealth employer  (1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following persons is a Commonwealth employer:  (a) a person who, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has the powers of an employer in respect of an employee of the Commonwealth;  (b) a body corporate that:  (i) is established by or under a law of the Commonwealth for a public purpose; and  (ii) has employees;  (c) a company that:  (i) is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); and  (ii) has employees. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00531"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c5fc428d31a529be568131c440c6c289a437fd7a523449e2c09f1f691e56e65c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prime Minister may issue directions about leave etc." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-civilian-corps-act-2011.pdf, p.17" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-civilian-corps-act-2011-sec-27-norm .
