    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may authorise the making of any of the following payments:  (a) one or more payments of an amount or amounts specified in the authorisation (or worked out in accordance with the authorisation);  (b) periodical payments of an amount specified in the authorisation (or worked out in accordance with the authorisation), during a period specified in the authorisation (or worked out in accordance with the authorisation)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer .

